  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC.  Measurements of the b jet pair transverse momentum asymmetry in proton-proton and lead-lead collisions at a centre-of-mass energy of 5.02 TeV with data collected in 2015.   The leading and subleading jets are required to be above 100 and 30 GeV, respectively.  Both jets are restricted to an absolute pseudorapidity of less than 1.6 units. \n",
